---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="新云媒介提案台 · FLAIR STUDIO"
  description="输入场馆、预算、媒介与档期，Agent 自动核验红豆实时库存并运行确定性求解器，产出四页交互方案与四套官方模板 PDF。"
  active="index"
>
<main id="top">
  <!-- Hero Stage -->
  <section class="hero-stage" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="hero-badge">
            <span class="hero-badge__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            上海新云传媒 · 确定性户外媒介提案引擎
          </div>

          <h1 id="hero-h" class="heading-2 hero-gradient-text" style="line-height:60px">
            让户外媒体提案<br />当天可交付，全链可复算
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-sub">
            输入场馆、预算、媒介与档期，Agent 自动拉取红豆 2027 实时可售库存与新云线路轨迹，由 CP-SAT 求解最优组合，一键导出 16:9 销售提案与标准合同。
          </p>

          <div class="hero-cta-row">
            <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/input.html">
              进入方案工作台
              <svg class="ico-arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4.5 10H15.5M15.5 10L11 5.5M15.5 10L11 14.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <span class="hero-proof-line">100–500 万可伸缩 · 逐行分摊零误差</span>
          </div>

          <dl class="hero-metrics">
            <div>
              <dt>默认 500 万方案</dt>
              <dd><span class="m-val" data-count-to="44">44</span><span class="m-unit">个付费点位</span></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>估算有效曝光</dt>
              <dd><span class="m-val">7,463.8</span><span class="m-unit">万人次</span></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>确定性求解耗时</dt>
              <dd><span class="m-val" data-count-to="2">2</span><span class="m-unit">秒出方案</span></dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Hero Showcase Bento -->
        <div class="hero-showcase" role="img" aria-label="示例方案预览：上海乐高乐园 2027 暑期 500 万方案">
          <div class="hero-showcase__inner">
            <div class="showcase-topbar">
              <span class="win-dot win-dot--gold"></span>
              <span class="win-dot"></span>
              <span class="win-dot"></span>
              <span class="showcase-title">上海乐高乐园 · 2027 暑期（8 周）</span>
              <span class="chip chip--ok mono" style="margin-left:auto">44 / 44 可售</span>
            </div>

            <div class="showcase-body">
              <div class="showcase-kpis">
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>有效曝光</span>
                  <b class="gold">7,463.8 万</b>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>目标 Reach</span>
                  <b class="em">82.0%</b>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>综合 CPM</span>
                  <b>63.05 元</b>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>公交车身</span>
                  <b>32 线 · 39 辆</b>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>地铁出入口</span>
                  <b>5 站 · 5 口</b>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-tile">
                  <span>触达频次</span>
                  <b>36.4 次</b>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="showcase-bars">
                <div class="sc-bar-row">
                  <span>折后媒体费配比</span>
                  <span class="mono">公交 72.1% · 地铁 27.9%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sc-bar-track">
                  <div class="sc-bar-bus"></div>
                  <div class="sc-bar-metro"></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="kv">
                <div><span>折后媒体发布费</span><b>470.56 万</b></div>
                <div><span>画面制作安装费</span><b>29.40 万</b></div>
                <div class="total"><span>方案应付总价</span><b>499.96 万</b></div>
              </div>

              <div class="showcase-foot">
                <span class="mono">SOLVER · OR-TOOLS CP-SAT</span>
                <span>含 16:9 提案 + 直客 / 4A 合同模板</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mandatory Scroll Tagline Reveal Section -->
  <section class="tagline-section" aria-label="核心价值宣言">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="tagline-wrap">
        <div class="tagline-eyebrow">01 · WHY DETERMINISTIC PROPOSAL STUDIO</div>
        <p class="tagline-reveal" data-tagline-reveal>
          <span class="tr-seg">把数天的人工查表与手工拼图，</span><span class="tr-seg tr-seg--gold">压缩成一次可验证的确定性推演。</span><span class="tr-seg">每一条公交线路的空车数、</span><span class="tr-seg">每一个地铁出入口的落位理由、</span><span class="tr-seg tr-seg--gold">每一分折后与制作分摊，</span><span class="tr-seg">皆源自实时库存并直通签约文档。</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three-Step Bento Process -->
  <section class="home-section" id="steps" aria-labelledby="steps-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="sec-eyebrow">02 · WORKFLOW ARCHITECTURE</div>
          <h2 id="steps-h" class="heading-3">三步闭环，从一句话需求到可签单 PDF</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="t-small muted" style="max-width:44ch">
          AI 负责理解意图、编排取数与解释策略；组合优化、折扣不动点与价格分摊全部交由确定性数学模型执行。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bento-3" data-reveal>
        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="sv-row"><span>目标场馆</span><b>上海乐高乐园度假区</b></div>
            <div class="sv-row"><span>预算规模</span><b class="gold mono">500 万</b></div>
            <div class="sv-row"><span>媒介组合</span><span class="chip chip--accent">公交 + 地铁</span></div>
            <div class="sv-row"><span>投放档期</span><b class="mono">2027-07-01 · 8 周</b></div>
          </div>
          <span class="step-num">STEP 01</span>
          <h3>结构化输入与 Brief 解析</h3>
          <p>支持场馆、预算、媒介、档期与直客/4A 切换，附带一句话需求解析；缺失档期绝不静默换月。</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="sv-flow">
              <span class="sv-node">红豆库存</span>
              <span class="muted">→</span>
              <span class="sv-node">最小可售</span>
              <span class="muted">→</span>
              <span class="sv-node sv-node--gold">CP-SAT 求解</span>
            </div>
            <div class="sv-row" style="margin-top:8px"><span>新云 AI 线路</span><b class="mono" style="color:var(--emerald)">真实轨迹注入</b></div>
          </div>
          <span class="step-num">STEP 02</span>
          <h3>双技能取数与确定性优化</h3>
          <p>自动调度红豆实时可售库存与新云大数据平台轨迹，严格校验库存上限、夜间施工产能与预算边界。</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card step-card">
          <div class="step-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="sv-tabs">
              <div class="sv-tab is-on"><span>16:9 销售提案</span><span class="mono">PPT</span></div>
              <div class="sv-tab"><span>直客发布合同</span><span class="mono">M3</span></div>
              <div class="sv-tab"><span>4A 排期订单</span><span class="mono">Spot</span></div>
              <div class="sv-tab"><span>4A 框架合同</span><span class="mono">18条</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="step-num">STEP 03</span>
          <h3>四页工作台与官方模板导出</h3>
          <p>概览、地图、报价排期与效果校验联动展示，一键生成新云官方 16:9 销售提案与三套标准签约合同 PDF。</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="scope-strip" data-reveal>
        <p>
          <b style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;margin-right:8px">数据口径与透明边界</b>
          库存数据取自红豆广告媒体管理系统 2027 月度可售快照（跨月取最小可售）；公交与地铁线路轨迹来自新云大数据可视化平台 2023-05 快照，仅用于地图可视化展示；曝光、Reach、Frequency 与 CPM 为确定性模型估算。
        </p>
        <span class="chip chip--quiet mono">VERSION <span data-meta-version>—</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing CTA Band -->
  <section class="closing-band" aria-labelledby="close-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="closing-card" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <h2 id="close-h">现在就生成一份完整投放方案</h2>
          <p>调动实时库存、确定性求解与新云官方 PDF 模板，全链路本地闭环运行。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/input.html">
          开始生成方案
          <svg class="ico-arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M4.5 10H15.5M15.5 10L11 5.5M15.5 10L11 14.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
  // Load live manifest version/timestamp for footer & scope strip
  fetch('/api/meta')
    .then((r) => r.json())
    .then((meta) => {
      const m = meta.manifest || {};
      const ver = m.data_version || '—';
      const ts = String(m.inventory_ts || '—').replace('T', ' ').slice(0, 16);
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-meta-version]').forEach((el) => { el.textContent = ver; });
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-meta-ts]').forEach((el) => { el.textContent = ts; });
    })
    .catch(() => {});

  // Smooth count-up roll for hero numeric counters
  const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  if (!reduced) {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-count-to]').forEach((el) => {
      const target = Number(el.dataset.countTo || 0);
      if (!target) return;
      const start = performance.now();
      const dur = 820;
      const step = (now: number) => {
        const t = Math.min(1, (now - start) / dur);
        const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
        el.textContent = String(Math.max(1, Math.round(target * eased)));
        if (t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        else el.textContent = String(target);
      };
      requestAnimationFrame(step);
    });
  }

  // Mandatory Tagline Reveal (B11): phrase-by-phrase scroll illumination via rAF-throttled scroll
  const tagEl = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-tagline-reveal]');
  if (tagEl) {
    const segs = [...tagEl.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.tr-seg')];
    if (reduced) {
      segs.forEach((s) => s.classList.add('is-lit'));
    } else {
      let ticking = false;
      const update = () => {
        ticking = false;
        const rect = tagEl.getBoundingClientRect();
        const vh = window.innerHeight || 800;
        const progress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (vh * 0.84 - rect.top) / (vh * 0.56)));
        const litCount = Math.ceil(progress * segs.length);
        segs.forEach((s, i) => s.classList.toggle('is-lit', i < litCount));
      };
      window.addEventListener(
        'scroll',
        () => {
          if (!ticking) {
            ticking = true;
            requestAnimationFrame(update);
          }
        },
        { passive: true },
      );
      update();
    }
  }
</script>
</Base>
